      "lineNbr": 4875,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T15:34:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is no usage for as of now. However, in a future scenario where userspace binder is older than the driver this info could come handy. b/191910201#comment12\n\nPerhaps it makes sense to reduce the scope of this variable to function local instead and the refactor once (if ever) is needed?",
      "parentUuid": "05c4cc1c_ef77da4e",
      "revId": "f75be47c0bcfa9d3178e6d2da11b5c5f08e66018",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
