      "writtenOn": "2021-06-30T15:34:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "this is the behavior that started the conversation for this patch and it makes sense to fix it. I\u0027ll sync with smoreland@ if we want to keep this. Either way this seems small and trivial enough to add to this change. I can send a separate commit with s/pr_info/pr_err or whatever it is otherwise.",
      "parentUuid": "02e6fbe4_2704b3ec",
      "range": {
